人民的利益，并要求对方国家因为破坏我们的独眼漫步者星座支付了赔偿。","en":"We looked out for the interests of our people and demanded due payment for the damage done to the star constellation the One-eyed Wanderer.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":29,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":29,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75483"},{"key":"opinion_dysonsphere_insult","zh":"冷嘲热讽","en":"Shots Fired","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":30,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":30,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75484"},{"key":"opinion_dysonsphere_insult_desc","zh":"他们羞辱了我们的体型。","en":"They insulted our physique.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":31,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":31,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75485"},{"key":"energy_utopia_57","zh":"财富之泉","en":"Fountain of Gold","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":32,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":32,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75486"},{"key":"energy_utopia_57_desc","zh":"一个如同奇迹一般的抗衰老药膏正供不应求。","en":"Our new miracle anti-aging cream is in demand.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":33,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":33,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75487"},{"key":"research_utopia_60","zh":"神经库","en":"Neural Bank","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":34,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":34,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75488"},{"key":"research_utopia_60_desc","zh":"神经库的发明可以显著提高我们的工程科技研究速度。","en":"The invention of a neural bank has allowed us to improve our engineering research speed.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":35,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":35,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75489"},{"key":"adding_unrest_slaves","zh":"激进的奴隶","en":"Slaves Radicalizing","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":36,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":36,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75490"},{"key":"adding_unrest_slaves_desc","zh":"激进的奴隶们正在聚集，散布着不安的气息。","en":"Radical slave elements are rallying, spreading unrest.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":37,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":37,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75491"},{"key":"withdrawal_symptoms","zh":"戒断症状","en":"Withdrawal Symptoms","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"localisation/english/modifiers_utopia_l_english.yml","el":38,"zs":"localisation/simp_chinese/modifiers_utopia_l_simp_chinese.yml","zl":38,"status":"paired","id":"texts:75492"},{"key":"withdrawal_symptoms_desc","zh":"走出§Y化学极乐§!制造的与世隔绝、无忧无虑的幸福世界通常都会伴随着痛苦，但这种痛苦稍纵即逝。当人们意识到自己眼前那令人陶醉的多彩景象全都是虚幻时，这种痛苦才是悲痛欲绝，或许人们永远都不能从这份痛苦中解脱出来。","en":"Emergence from §YChemical Bliss§! and its detached, cushioned world of instant gratification is often painful, but pain is fleeting. It is the deeper scars - from realizing that one's favorite colorful animations are not real - that may never heal.","source":"modifiers_utopia","category":"科技与发展","namespace":"gameplay","es":"